### Whole-phase Builder procedure

1. Verify and record the supplied vulnerable base commit.
2. Run `secb build`; repair only build/setup failures while preserving sanitizer flags.
3. Declare real Builder-produced executable paths and record the build/setup diff.
4. Establish the Builder-adjusted local baseline using the phase contract above.
5. Print every required artifact and the build log before concluding.

Do not disable sanitizer instrumentation or include vulnerability-fix changes in Builder output.
